# Code owners for isw-kudos/github-actions.
#
# This repo is the canonical, public source of reusable workflows/actions
# consumed cross-org, so any change under .github/ (workflow definitions, the
# actions they call, and this file itself) must be reviewed by an admin team.
# CODEOWNERS only *requests* the review; the default-branch ruleset
# (require_code_owner_review) is what blocks the merge. The owning team must
# have write access or GitHub silently ignores these lines.
#
# Last match wins — keep the CODEOWNERS line last so a broader pattern can't
# take over ownership of this file.

/.github/                 @isw-kudos/huddo-codeowners
/.github/workflows/       @isw-kudos/huddo-codeowners
/.github/actions/         @isw-kudos/huddo-codeowners
/.github/CODEOWNERS        @isw-kudos/huddo-codeowners
